---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { articles } from '../../data/insights';

const latest = articles[0];

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "@id": "https://gavelin.net/#urban-gavelin",
  "name": "Urban Gavelin",
  "jobTitle": "B2B Sales Advisor and Founder",
  "url": "https://gavelin.net/en/urban-gavelin/",
  "sameAs": ["https://powersales.se", "https://www.linkedin.com/in/urbangavelin/", "https://www.youtube.com/@PSCBusinessAcademy"]
};
---

<Base
  title="Urban Gavelin | B2B Sales, Communication & AI Support"
  description="Urban Gavelin helps B2B companies sell smarter with clearer communication, stronger sales discipline and practical AI support via Powersales Communication."
  lang="en"
  schema={schema}
>

  <h1>B2B sales needs more human sharpness.<br/>Not more digital noise.</h1>
  <p class="lead">I'm Urban Gavelin. I help B2B companies sell smarter with clearer communication, stronger sales discipline and practical AI support.</p>

  <div class="section" style="background:#f8f8f8; padding:1.5rem; border-radius:4px;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.75rem; font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-text-muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em;">Why it matters</p>
    <ul style="margin:0; padding-left:1.25rem;">
      <li>67% of B2B sales reps don't expect to hit quota — primarily due to lack of system, not lack of effort. <em>(Salesforce State of Sales)</em></li>
      <li>Complex B2B deals involve an average of 6–10 decision-makers — yet most sales processes are built for a single contact. <em>(Gartner)</em></li>
      <li>Sales reps spend an average of just 28% of their time on actual selling — the rest goes to administration and tool-switching. <em>(Salesforce)</em></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>Not AI because it sounds modern.<br/>
    Not sales training that dies in the conference room.<br/>
    Not more activities that exhaust everyone but make no one wiser.</p>
    <p>Good sales still depends on people. But people need better systems.</p>
    <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn">Book a call</a>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <h3>Commercial clarity</h3>
    <p>Who should you win, why should the customer care, and where is the sales process leaking today?</p>
    <h3>Communication that builds trust</h3>
    <p>Sales isn't just decided by what you say. It's decided by how the customer understands, feels, and dares to move forward.</p>
    <h3>AI support that strengthens the sales process</h3>
    <p>AI shouldn't replace human influence. AI should remove friction, raise quality and free up time for better customer conversations.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Powersales AI-Sales OS</h2>
    <p>My framework for how B2B companies can combine strategy, human communication and AI-supported workflows into a coherent sales system.</p>
    <a href="/en/ai-sales-os/">Learn more about AI-Sales OS &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Insights</h2>
    <p>Articles and newsletters on B2B sales, AI and commercial leadership. No fluff.</p>
    <div style="margin: 1.25rem 0; padding: 1.25rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent, #0066cc); background: #f8f8f8; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Latest insight</p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem;"><a href={latest.url}><strong>{latest.title}</strong></a></p>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-muted);">{latest.date} &mdash; {latest.category}</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/en/insights/">All insights &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>For whom?</h2>
    <p>I primarily work with CEOs, sales managers, founders and commercial teams in B2B companies with complex sales — where pipeline looks better than it is, deals get stuck, and AI is used ad hoc without clear business logic.</p>
    <p>That's not unusual. It's just expensive.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">

      <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h3 itemprop="name">What does Urban Gavelin do?</h3>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p itemprop="text">Urban Gavelin is a B2B sales advisor and founder of Powersales Communication. He helps B2B companies improve sales performance, communication and commercial governance through advisory, training, workshops and AI-supported sales systems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h3 itemprop="name">What is Powersales AI-Sales OS?</h3>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p itemprop="text">Powersales AI-Sales OS is a framework for B2B companies that combines strategy, human communication and AI-supported workflows into one coherent sales system. It is not a software tool — it is an operating model for how companies create pipeline, drive deals forward and learn faster than the market.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h3 itemprop="name">Who does Urban Gavelin work with?</h3>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p itemprop="text">Urban Gavelin works primarily with CEOs, sales managers, founders and commercial teams in B2B companies with complex sales cycles — where sales cycles are long, multiple decision-makers are involved, and pipeline discipline is inconsistent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h3 itemprop="name">What is the D.E.A.L. Framework?</h3>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p itemprop="text">D.E.A.L. is a framework for building scalable B2B revenue systems: Data (clean CRM data as the foundation), Execution (a repeatable documented sales process), Augmentation (AI support that reduces friction) and Leadership (coaching-oriented sales leadership that turns frameworks into results).</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h3 itemprop="name">How do I book a call with Urban Gavelin?</h3>
        <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
          <p itemprop="text">Send an email to urban.gavelin@powersales.se or visit the contact page at gavelin.net. The call is 30 minutes and is about understanding if and how advisory, training or AI-Sales OS can help your organisation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn">Book a 30-minute call</a>
  </div>

</Base>
